{"id":328,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It builds nests that double as traps, lying in wait for its prey to get caught. When night falls, it digs itself a spot beneath the sand to sleep."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its jaws are strong enough to crush rocks but so heavy that it can’t get up if it flips over. Sandile seize those moments as their chance."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"As it digs through the sand, its giant jaws crush any rocks that obstruct its path. It builds a funnel-shaped nest."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can live for a week without eating a thing. It waits patiently at the bottom of its nest for prey to appear."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Trapinch is a patient hunter. It digs an inescapable pit in a desert and waits for its prey to come tumbling down. This Pokémon can go a whole week without access to any water."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Trapinch’s nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit dug in sand. This Pokémon patiently waits for prey to tumble down the pit. Its giant jaws have enough strength to crush even boulders."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its big jaws crunch through boulders. Because its head is so big, it has a hard time getting back upright if it tips over onto its back."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hyper Cutter","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's prized, mighty pincers prevent other Pokémon from lowering its Attack stat."},{"name":"Arena Trap","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents opposing Pokémon from fleeing from battle."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":true,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."}],"eggGroups":["Bug","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Brown","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":328,"name":"Trapinch","condition":null,"children":[{"id":329,"name":"Vibrava","condition":"Lv. 35","children":[{"id":330,"name":"Flygon","condition":"Lv. 45","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,28],[1,310],[8,44],[12,189],[16,328],[20,523],[24,91],[28,242],[32,201],[36,414],[40,89],[44,276],[48,90]],"machine":[34,450,523,242,91,414,89,203,263,202,63,341,189,182,156,157,317,328,201,815,214,446,444,522,164,241,36,851],"egg":[450,364,660,175,210,16,98],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2-51","name":"Trapinch","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Common","number":"51","artist":"Uta","img":"me2/51"},{"id":"sv8-104","name":"Trapinch","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Common","number":"104","artist":null,"img":"sv8/104"},{"id":"swsh9-74","name":"Trapinch","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Common","number":"74","artist":"zig","img":"swsh9/74"},{"id":"swsh45-40","name":"Trapinch","set":"Shining Fates","date":"2021-02-19","rarity":"Common","number":"40","artist":"MAHOU","img":"swsh45/40"},{"id":"swsh3-89","name":"Trapinch","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Common","number":"89","artist":"Asako Ito","img":"swsh3/89"},{"id":"sm12-107","name":"Trapinch","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"107","artist":"sowsow","img":"sm12/107"},{"id":"sm12-108","name":"Trapinch","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"108","artist":"Midori Harada","img":"sm12/1